    "Drop a file named like one of Koru's sounds (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) in the sounds folder to replace it, then Reload." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ضع في مجلد الأصوات ملفًا يحمل اسم أحد أصوات Koru (finish.wav وapproval.mp3 وgreet.m4a…) ليحل محله، ثم أعد التحميل."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Koru-র কোনো সাউন্ডের নামে একটি ফাইল (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) সাউন্ড ফোল্ডারে রাখুন, সেটি বদলে যাবে; তারপর Reload করুন।"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege eine Datei mit dem Namen eines Koru-Klangs (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) im Klangordner ab, um ihn zu ersetzen. Lade die Klänge anschließend neu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drop a file named like one of Koru's sounds (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) in the sounds folder to replace it, then Reload."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deja en la carpeta de sonidos un archivo con el nombre de uno de los sonidos de Koru (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) para reemplazarlo y luego recarga."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Déposez dans le dossier des sons un fichier nommé comme l'un des sons de Koru (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) pour le remplacer, puis rechargez."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Koru की किसी साउंड के नाम वाली फ़ाइल (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) साउंड फ़ोल्डर में रखें, वह उसकी जगह ले लेगी; फिर Reload करें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Taruh file bernama seperti salah satu suara Koru (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) di folder suara untuk menggantinya, lalu muat ulang."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Koru のサウンドと同じ名前のファイル（finish.wav、approval.mp3、greet.m4a…）をサウンドフォルダに入れると置き換えられます。その後「再読み込み」を押してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "코루의 사운드와 같은 이름의 파일(finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…)을 sounds 폴더에 넣으면 교체돼요. 그다음 다시 불러오기!"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coloque na pasta de sons um arquivo com o nome de um dos sons da Koru (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) para substituí-lo e depois recarregue."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Положите в папку звуков файл с именем одного из звуков Koru (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…), чтобы заменить его, затем перезагрузите."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "วางไฟล์ที่ตั้งชื่อตรงกับเสียงของ Koru (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) ในโฟลเดอร์ sounds เพื่อแทนที่ แล้วโหลดใหม่"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Koru'nin seslerinden birini değiştirmek için aynı adı taşıyan bir dosyayı (finish.wav, approval.mp3, greet.m4a…) sesler klasörüne bırak, ardından sesleri yeniden yükle."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在声音文件夹中放入与 Koru 某个声音同名的文件（finish.wav、approval.mp3、greet.m4a…）即可替换它，然后重新载入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將與 Koru 音效同名的檔案（finish.wav、approval.mp3、greet.m4a…）放入音效資料夾即可取代原音效，再按「重新載入」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
